  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "&nbsp;If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> are unit vectors, then the greatest value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>|</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></math> is<br />&nbsp;",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let angle between&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math>.<br />So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>|</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos&#945;</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos&#945;</mi></msqrt></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>As&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, given expression is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Thus, maximum value is<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><msup><mfenced><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>",
